---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Life with Yukki"
  description="Privacy policy for Life with Yukki website and newsletter"
>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">How we handle your data</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="policy-content card">
          <p class="last-updated">Last updated: July 19, 2026</p>

          <h2>Controller</h2>
          <p>
            Nesil Ozer<br />
            Friedrich-Kaiser-Straße 12<br />
            55270 Ober-Olm<br />
            Germany<br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:yukkitoslife@outlook.com">yukkitoslife@outlook.com</a>
          </p>

          <h2>What We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you subscribe to Yukki's Sniff Report, we collect only your email address.
            We don't share your data with third parties.
          </p>

          <h2>Cookies & Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            Only if you consent via the cookie banner, we use Google Analytics 4, a web
            analytics service provided by Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow
            Street, Dublin 4, Ireland, to understand how visitors use our site.
          </p>
          <p>
            Legal basis for storing and reading information on your device is your consent
            under §25(1) TDDDG; legal basis for the subsequent processing of personal data
            is your consent under Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR. Data may be transferred to Google LLC
            in the USA. Google LLC is certified under the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Your choice matters:</strong> When you first visit, we ask for your consent
            before any analytics cookies are set. You can decline, and the site works perfectly
            without them. You can withdraw your consent at any time via the "Cookie settings"
            link in the footer; withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing before
            the withdrawal (Art. 7(3) GDPR).
          </p>
          <p>Cookies we use (only with your consent):</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>_ga, _ga_*</strong> - Google Analytics cookies for visitor statistics, stored for up to 2 years</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Your cookie choice itself and your language preference are saved in your
            browser's local storage. This is strictly necessary and permitted without
            consent under §25(2) No. 2 TDDDG.
          </p>

          <h2>How We Use Your Email</h2>
          <p>
            Your email is used solely to send you updates about Yukki - new blog posts,
            photos, and occasional Shiba Inu tips. We won't spam you or share your
            email with anyone else.
          </p>

          <h2>Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You can:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Unsubscribe anytime</strong> - Every email has an unsubscribe link</li>
            <li><strong>Request deletion</strong> - Email us and we'll remove your data</li>
            <li><strong>Ask questions</strong> - Contact us about how your data is used</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Data Storage</h2>
          <p>
            Your email is stored securely with our email service provider. We don't
            store your data on our own servers.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about privacy? Email us at
            <a href="mailto:yukkitoslife@outlook.com">yukkitoslife@outlook.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .page-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .page-header h1 {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-size: var(--font-size-4xl);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .page-subtitle {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
      color: var(--color-text-light);
    }

    .content-wrapper {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .policy-content {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .last-updated {
      font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    }

    .policy-content h2 {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
      margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .policy-content h2:first-of-type {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .policy-content p {
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .policy-content ul {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
      padding-left: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .policy-content li {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .policy-content a {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .policy-content a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
